- Responsive, mobile-first UI using SvelteKit server routes/actions. [OBLIGATORIO]
- PostgreSQL in EU via Neon. [OBLIGATORIO]
- Better Auth for user management. [OBLIGATORIO]
- Data migration from the existing system and final data export on contract end. [OBLIGATORIO]
- Basic wireframes (desktop & mobile) for all major screens. [OBLIGATORIO]
- English/Spanish/Euskera i18n with externalizable keys. [OBLIGATORIO]
- GDPR compliance: data minimization, pseudonymization, audit logs, retention policies. [OBLIGATORIO]

**Out-of-Scope (Phase 1):**
- Native mobile apps (iOS/Android) or offline PWA caching. [CONFIRMAR]
