## 6. Non-Functional Requirements

- **Performance**: API median response <200ms; initial page load <2s on 3G mobile. [CONFIRMAR]
- **Scalability**: Support 600+ user accounts, 5+ roles, 100 concurrent mobile sessions. [OBLIGATORIO]
- **Security**: HTTPS/TLS; encryption at rest for sensitive data; OWASP Top 10 defense; input sanitization; file‐upload scanning. [OBLIGATORIO]
- **Compliance**: GDPR & Spanish data protection; data residency in EU; no US-hosted services without legal clearance. [OBLIGATORIO] [VALIDACIÓN JURÍDICA]
- **Usability & Accessibility**: Mobile-first; WCAG 2.1 AA [PROPUESTA] (navigation via keyboard, visible focus, contrast 4.5:1, alt text) [CONFIRMAR]
- **Internationalization**: Full support for Spanish/Euskera with external keys, no auto-translation. [OBLIGATORIO]
- **Reliability**: Daily backups with 7-day PITR; multi-AZ DB replication. [PROPUESTA]
- **Maintainability**: Clean code, modular boundaries, automated tests, linting & formatting. [OBLIGATORIO]

## 7. Constraints & Assumptions

- **Contractual Stack**: Must use Svelte/SvelteKit, TypeScript, Neon, Better Auth; no changes. (PCAP)
- **No Subcontracting**: All servers, storage and logs in EU; no third-party cloud without explicit contract. [VALIDACIÓN JURÍDICA]
- **Template Details Pending**: PDF certificates, inspection forms, report layouts, credential formats to be confirmed by Ayuntamiento. [CONFIRMAR]
- **GIS Provider**: Unspecified—must remain pluggable. [CONFIRMAR]
- **Data Migration**: Existing export mechanism will be provided. [ASSUMPTION]
- **User Roles**: Final names & permissions matrix to be validated. [CONFIRMAR]
- **Browser Support**: Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari on Windows, macOS, Linux; responsive to 320px width. [OBLIGATORIO]

## 8. Known Issues & Potential Pitfalls

- **Missing Official Templates**: Certificate, inspection form and report templates are undefined. Mitigation: build configurable template engine, mark fields as [CONFIRMAR].
- **GIS & Map Tiles**: No provider/license defined; could delay mapping module. Mitigation: abstract map layer, use open-source tiles by default. [CONFIRMAR]
- **Legal Approval**: Third-party communications, external storage or analytics may violate PCAP. Mitigation: require legal sign-off before integration. [VALIDACIÓN JURÍDICA]
- **Performance on Mobile**: Large geoJSON layers may slow low-end devices. Mitigation: implement server-side clustering & tile pre‐processing.
- **PDF Library Limitations**: Generating secure, signed certificates may need specialized tooling. Mitigation: evaluate PDFKit vs. Puppeteer early.
- **Data Portability**: Future system reversal demands clear DB access layer and export scripts. Mitigation: enforce repository pattern and avoid provider-locked features.
- **Role/Permission Complexity**: RBAC matrix is large; risk of misconfiguration. Mitigation: auto-generate permission lists from code and include self-service UI.

